152
00:13:52,004 --> 00:13:52,304
おー。
Ooh.

153
00:13:56,904 --> 00:13:59,974
い、いぬ…いーの先輩、ARK初めてですか？
Ino-senpai, is this your first time playing ARK?

154
00:14:00,104 --> 00:14:00,694
初めてです！
It's my first time!

155
00:14:01,834 --> 00:14:02,124
オッケー。
Okay.

156
